2026-09-25T04:53:44.9780665Z settled rules (verification/infrastructure/v3/architecture.md):
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9782494Z   K1  the preregistration at F carries one `v3-round` block: round <id>, kind <sealing|non-sealing>, record-directory <path>/, the one directory holding every control-plane path of delta(D, F); the receipt must agree with it
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9784716Z   K2  at F the preregistration carries exactly one `v3-governed-paths` block and exactly one `v3-round` block, and no amendment carries either
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9786341Z   K3  for every reconciliation, D lies on the first-parent chain of its first parent; for i>1, the previous first parent lies on the first-parent chain of this one
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9788377Z   K4  every receipt commit, superseded or final, is a single-parent child of the reconciliation before it, changing exactly the receipt path plus the seal records the final receipt names; a superseded receipt is not read
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9790267Z   G5  the execution commits of a halted round are linear from F and change no control-plane file; their delta from F need not be authorized
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9792373Z   G6  the governed-path block at F has literal record entries for the record directory and the receipt path, no execution entry within the record directory, and no other record entry outside it but a sealing round's `record A` of its seal record path
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9794618Z   G7  at every commit of the round after F, superseded or final, the control-plane files are exactly those at F, each with its state at F
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9795864Z   G8  no ref, branch or host state is a predicate input; a control plane that names one changes no predicate
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9797150Z   G9  before F the control plane is a draft: its commits may add, modify or delete control-plane files, and only the declarations at F are read
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9799052Z   G10 declaration blocks are recognized by exact lines: an opener is three backticks and the info string, a closer three backticks; a near miss of a reserved info string in any control-plane file at F makes the control plane invalid
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9800223Z   G11 the reconciliations and receipt commits of the round are exactly the chain Q reaches; an abandoned attempt is not an object of the round
2026-09-25T04:53:44.9801403Z   G12 a sealing round has one seal record, verification/v3-seals/<round>.json, declared `record A` and named alone by its receipt; no round changes another round's receipt or V3 seal record, or any path under verification/seals/
